      "description": "An intelligent undead with blood-stained lips and a predator’s smile.",
      "features": [
        {
          "name": "Draining Bite",
          "kind": "Action",
          "rulesText": "Make an attack against a target within Melee range. On a success, deal 5d4 physical damage. A target who marks HP from this attack loses a Hope and must mark a Stress. The Vampire then clears a HP."
