    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/bold-presence",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Bold Presence",
      "slug": "bold-presence",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOLD PRESENCE",
        "lineStart": 16282,
        "lineEnd": 16290,
        "pdfPageStart": 223,
        "pdfPageEnd": 223
      },
      "level": 2,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/valor"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 0,
      "rulesText": "When you make a Presence Roll, you can spend a Hope to add your Strength to the roll.\n\nAdditionally, once per rest when you would gain a condition, you can describe how your bold presence aids you in the situation and avoid gaining the condition.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/bold-presence/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/bolt-beacon",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Bolt Beacon",
      "slug": "bolt-beacon",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOLT BEACON",
        "lineStart": 16046,
        "lineEnd": 16052,
        "pdfPageStart": 221,
        "pdfPageEnd": 221
      },
      "level": 1,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/splendor"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Far range. On a success, spend a Hope to send a bolt of shimmering light toward them, dealing d8+2 magic damage using your Proficiency. The target becomes temporarily Vulnerable and glows brightly until this condition is cleared.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/bolt-beacon/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/bone-touched",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Bone‑touched",
      "slug": "bone-touched",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BONE‑TOUCHED",
        "lineStart": 14907,
        "lineEnd": 14916,
        "pdfPageStart": 210,
        "pdfPageEnd": 210
      },
      "level": 7,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/bone"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "When 4 or more of the domain cards in your loadout are from the Bone domain, gain the following benefits:\n\n  - +1 bonus to Agility\n  - Once per rest, you can spend 3 Hope to cause an attack that succeeded against you to fail instead.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/bone-touched/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/book-of-ava",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Book of Ava",
      "slug": "book-of-ava",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOOK OF AVA",
        "lineStart": 14980,
        "lineEnd": 14990,
        "pdfPageStart": 211,
        "pdfPageEnd": 211
      },
      "level": 1,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Grimoire",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Power Push: Make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Melee range. On a success, they’re knocked back to Far range and take d10+2 magic damage using your Proficiency.\n\nTava’s Armor: Spend a Hope to give a target you can touch a +1 bonus to their Armor Score until their next rest or you cast Tava’s Armor again.\n\nIce Spike: Make a Spellcast Roll (12) to summon a large ice spike within Far range. If you use it as a weapon, make the Spellcast Roll against the target’s Difficulty instead. On a success, deal d6 physical damage using your Proficiency.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/book-of-ava/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/book-of-exota",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Book of Exota",
      "slug": "book-of-exota",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOOK OF EXOTA",
        "lineStart": 15062,
        "lineEnd": 15070,
        "pdfPageStart": 211,
        "pdfPageEnd": 211
      },
      "level": 4,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Grimoire",
      "recallCost": 3,
      "rulesText": "Repudiate: You can interrupt a magical effect taking place. Make a reaction roll using your Spellcast trait. Once per rest on a success, the effect stops and any consequences are avoided.\n\nCreate Construct: Spend a Hope to choose a group of objects around you and create an animated construct from them that obeys basic commands. Make a Spellcast Roll to command them to take action. When necessary, they share your Evasion and traits and their attacks deal 2d10+3 physical damage. You can only maintain one construct at a time, and they fall apart when they take any amount of damage.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/book-of-exota/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/book-of-grynn",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Book of Grynn",
      "slug": "book-of-grynn",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOOK OF GRYNN",
        "lineStart": 15074,
        "lineEnd": 15084,
        "pdfPageStart": 212,
        "pdfPageEnd": 212
      },
      "level": 4,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Grimoire",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Arcane Deflection: Once per long rest, spend a Hope to negate the damage of an attack targeting you or an ally within Very Close range.\n\nTime Lock: Target an object within Far range. That object stops in time and space exactly where it is until your next rest. If a creature tries to move it, make a Spellcast Roll against them to maintain this spell.\n\nWall of Flame: Make a Spellcast Roll (15). On a success, create a temporary wall of magical flame between two points within Far range. All creatures in its path must choose a side to be on, and anything that subsequently passes through the wall takes 4d10+3 magic damage.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/book-of-grynn/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/book-of-homet",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Book of Homet",
      "slug": "book-of-homet",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOOK OF HOMET",
        "lineStart": 15127,
        "lineEnd": 15135,
        "pdfPageStart": 212,
        "pdfPageEnd": 212
      },
      "level": 7,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Grimoire",
      "recallCost": 0,
      "rulesText": "Pass Through: Make a Spellcast Roll (13). Once per rest on a success, you and all creatures touching you can pass through a wall or door within Close range. The effect ends once everyone is on the other side.\n\nPlane Gate: Make a Spellcast Roll (14). Once per long rest on a success, open a gateway to a location in another dimension or plane of existence you’ve been to before. This gateway lasts until your next rest.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/book-of-homet/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/book-of-illiat",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Book of Illiat",
      "slug": "book-of-illiat",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOOK OF ILLIAT",
        "lineStart": 14992,
        "lineEnd": 15002,
        "pdfPageStart": 211,
        "pdfPageEnd": 211
      },
      "level": 1,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Grimoire",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Slumber: Make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Very Close range. On a success, they’re Asleep until they take damage or the GM spends a Fear on their turn to clear this condition.\n\nArcane Barrage: Once per rest, spend any number of Hope and shoot magical projectiles that strike a target of your choice within Close range. Roll a number of d6s equal to the Hope spent and deal that much magic damage to the target.\n\nTelepathy: Spend a Hope to open a line of mental communication with one target you can see. This connection lasts until your next rest or you cast Telepathy again.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/book-of-illiat/"
      },
      "source": {
