    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/book-of-korvax",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Book of Korvax",
      "slug": "book-of-korvax",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOOK OF KORVAX",
        "lineStart": 15040,
        "lineEnd": 15050,
        "pdfPageStart": 211,
        "pdfPageEnd": 211
      },
      "level": 3,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Grimoire",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Levitation: Make a Spellcast Roll to temporarily lift a target you can see up into the air and move them within Close range of their original position.\n\nRecant: Spend a Hope to force a target within Melee range to make a Reaction Roll (15). On a failure, they forget the last minute of your conversation.\n\nRune Circle: Mark a Stress to create a temporary magical circle on the ground where you stand. All adversaries within Melee range, or who enter Melee range, take 2d12+4 magic damage and are knocked back to Very Close range.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/book-of-korvax/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/book-of-norai",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Book of Norai",
      "slug": "book-of-norai",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOOK OF NORAI",
        "lineStart": 15052,
        "lineEnd": 15060,
        "pdfPageStart": 211,
        "pdfPageEnd": 211
      },
      "level": 3,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Grimoire",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Mystic Tether: Make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Far range. On a success, they’re temporarily Restrained and must mark a Stress. If you target a flying creature, this spell grounds and temporarily Restrains them.\n\nFireball: Make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Very Far range. On a success, hurl a sphere of fire toward them that explodes on impact. The target and all creatures within Very Close range of them must make a Reaction Roll (13). Targets who fail take d20+5 magic damage using your Proficiency. Targets who succeed take half damage.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/book-of-norai/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/book-of-ronin",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Book of Ronin",
      "slug": "book-of-ronin",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOOK OF RONIN",
        "lineStart": 15173,
        "lineEnd": 15181,
        "pdfPageStart": 213,
        "pdfPageEnd": 213
      },
      "level": 9,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Grimoire",
      "recallCost": 4,
      "rulesText": "Transform: Make a Spellcast Roll (15). On a success, transform into an inanimate object no larger than twice your normal size. You can remain in this shape until you take damage.\n\nEternal Enervation: Once per long rest, make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Close range. On a success, they become permanently Vulnerable. They can’t clear this condition by any means.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/book-of-ronin/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/book-of-sitil",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Book of Sitil",
      "slug": "book-of-sitil",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOOK OF SITIL",
        "lineStart": 15016,
        "lineEnd": 15026,
        "pdfPageStart": 211,
        "pdfPageEnd": 211
      },
      "level": 2,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Grimoire",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Adjust Appearance: You magically shift your appearance and clothing to avoid recognition.\n\nParallela: Spend 2 Hope to cast this spell on yourself or an ally within Close range. The next time the target makes an attack, they can hit an additional target within range that their attack roll would succeed against. You can only hold this spell on one creature at a time.\n\nIllusion: Make a Spellcast Roll (14). On a success, create a temporary visual illusion no larger than you within Close range that lasts for as long as you look at it. It holds up to scrutiny until an observer is within Melee range.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/book-of-sitil/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/book-of-tyfar",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Book of Tyfar",
      "slug": "book-of-tyfar",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOOK OF TYFAR",
        "lineStart": 15004,
        "lineEnd": 15014,
        "pdfPageStart": 211,
        "pdfPageEnd": 211
      },
      "level": 1,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Grimoire",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Wild Flame: Make a Spellcast Roll against up to three adversaries within Melee range. Targets you succeed against take 2d6 magic damage and must mark a Stress as flames erupt from your hand.\n\nMagic Hand: You conjure a magical hand with the same size and strength as your own within Far range.\n\nMysterious Mist: Make a Spellcast Roll (13) to cast a temporary thick fog that gathers in a stationary area within Very Close range. The fog heavily obscures this area and everything in it.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/book-of-tyfar/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/book-of-vagras",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Book of Vagras",
      "slug": "book-of-vagras",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOOK OF VAGRAS",
        "lineStart": 15028,
        "lineEnd": 15038,
        "pdfPageStart": 211,
        "pdfPageEnd": 211
      },
      "level": 2,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Grimoire",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Runic Lock: Make a Spellcast Roll (15) on an object you’re touching that can close (such as a lock, chest, or box). Once per rest on a success, you can lock the object so it can only be opened by creatures of your choice. Someone with access to magic and an hour of time to study the spell can break it.\n\nArcane Door: When you have no adversaries within Melee range, make a Spellcast Roll (13). On a success, spend a Hope to create a portal from where you are to a point within Far range you can see. It closes once a creature has passed through it.\n\nReveal: Make a Spellcast Roll. If there is anything magically hidden within Close range, it is revealed.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/book-of-vagras/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/book-of-vyola",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Book of Vyola",
      "slug": "book-of-vyola",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOOK OF VYOLA",
        "lineStart": 15151,
        "lineEnd": 15159,
        "pdfPageStart": 212,
        "pdfPageEnd": 212
      },
      "level": 8,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Grimoire",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Memory Delve: Make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Far range. On a success, peer into the target’s mind and ask the GM a question. The GM describes any memories the target has pertaining to the answer.\n\nShared Clarity: Once per long rest, spend a Hope to choose two willing creatures. When one of them would mark Stress, they can choose between the two of them who marks it. This spell lasts until their next rest.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/book-of-vyola/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/book-of-yarrow",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Book of Yarrow",
      "slug": "book-of-yarrow",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "BOOK OF YARROW",
        "lineStart": 15232,
        "lineEnd": 15240,
        "pdfPageStart": 213,
        "pdfPageEnd": 213
      },
      "level": 10,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Grimoire",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Timejammer: Make a Spellcast Roll (18). On a success, time temporarily slows to a halt for everyone within Far range except for you. It resumes the next time you make an action roll that targets another creature.\n\nMagic Immunity: Spend 5 Hope to become immune to magic damage until your next rest.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/book-of-yarrow/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/boost",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Boost",
      "slug": "boost",
      "sourceLocator": {
