      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Mark a Stress to boost off a willing ally within Close range, fling yourself into the air, and perform an aerial attack against a target within Far range. You have advantage on the attack, add a d10 to the damage roll, and end your move within Melee range of the target.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/boost/"
