    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/chain-lightning",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Chain Lightning",
      "slug": "chain-lightning",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "CHAIN LIGHTNING",
        "lineStart": 14478,
        "lineEnd": 14484,
        "pdfPageStart": 206,
        "pdfPageEnd": 206
      },
      "level": 5,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/arcana"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Mark 2 Stress to make a Spellcast Roll, unleashing lightning on all targets within Close range. Targets you succeed against must make a reaction roll with a Difficulty equal to the result of your Spellcast Roll. Targets who fail take 2d8+4 magic damage. Additional adversaries not already targeted by Chain Lightning and within Close range of previous targets who took damage must also make the reaction roll. Targets who fail take 2d8+4 magic damage. This chain continues until there are no more adversaries within range.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/chain-lightning/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/chains-of-affliction",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Chains of Affliction",
      "slug": "chains-of-affliction",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "CHAINS OF AFFLICTION",
        "lineStart": 15276,
        "lineEnd": 15282,
        "pdfPageStart": 213,
        "pdfPageEnd": 213
      },
      "level": 4,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/dread"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Mark 2 Stress to temporarily Chain a target within Close range. When a Chained creature deals damage, the target of their attack marks one fewer Hit Point than they normally would. You can’t have more than one creature Chained at a time.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/chains-of-affliction/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/champions-edge",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Champion’s Edge",
      "slug": "champions-edge",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "CHAMPION’S EDGE",
        "lineStart": 14661,
        "lineEnd": 14673,
        "pdfPageStart": 208,
        "pdfPageEnd": 208
      },
      "level": 5,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/blade"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "When you critically succeed on an attack, you can spend up to 3 Hope and choose one of the following options for each Hope spent:\n\n  - You clear a Hit Point.\n  - You clear an Armor Slot.\n  - The target must mark an additional Hit Point.\n\nYou can’t choose the same option more than once.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/champions-edge/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/chokehold",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Chokehold",
      "slug": "chokehold",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "CHOKEHOLD",
        "lineStart": 15646,
        "lineEnd": 15654,
        "pdfPageStart": 217,
        "pdfPageEnd": 217
      },
      "level": 3,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/midnight"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "When you position yourself behind a creature who’s about your size, you can mark a Stress to pull them into a chokehold, making them temporarily Vulnerable.\n\nWhen a creature attacks a target who is Vulnerable in this way, they deal an extra 2d6 damage.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/chokehold/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/cinder-grasp",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Cinder Grasp",
      "slug": "cinder-grasp",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "CINDER GRASP",
        "lineStart": 14428,
        "lineEnd": 14436,
        "pdfPageStart": 206,
        "pdfPageEnd": 206
      },
      "level": 2,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/arcana"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Melee range. On a success, the target instantly bursts into flames, takes 1d20+3 magic damage, and is temporarily lit On Fire.\n\nWhen a creature acts while On Fire, they must take an extra 2d6 magic damage if they are still On Fire at the end of their action.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/cinder-grasp/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/cloaking-blast",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Cloaking Blast",
      "slug": "cloaking-blast",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "CLOAKING BLAST",
        "lineStart": 14525,
        "lineEnd": 14531,
        "pdfPageStart": 207,
        "pdfPageEnd": 207
      },
      "level": 7,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/arcana"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "When you make a successful Spellcast Roll to cast a different spell, you can spend a Hope to become Cloaked. While Cloaked, you remain unseen if you are stationary when an adversary moves to where they would normally see you. When you move into or within an adversary’s line of sight or make an attack, you are no longer Cloaked.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/cloaking-blast/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/codex-touched",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Codex‑touched",
      "slug": "codex-touched",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "CODEX‑TOUCHED",
        "lineStart": 15137,
        "lineEnd": 15149,
        "pdfPageStart": 212,
        "pdfPageEnd": 212
      },
      "level": 7,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "When 4 or more of the domain cards in your loadout are from the Codex domain, gain the following benefits:\n\n  - You can mark a Stress to add your Proficiency to a\n\nSpellcast Roll.\n\n  - Once per rest, replace this card with any card from your vault without paying its Recall Cost.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/codex-touched/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/confusing-aura",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Confusing Aura",
      "slug": "confusing-aura",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "CONFUSING AURA",
        "lineStart": 14541,
        "lineEnd": 14547,
        "pdfPageStart": 207,
        "pdfPageEnd": 207
      },
      "level": 8,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/arcana"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Make a Spellcast Roll (14). Once per long rest on a success, you create a layer of illusion over your body that makes it hard to tell exactly where you are. Mark any number of Stress to make that many additional layers. When an adversary makes an attack against you, roll a number of d6s equal to the number of layers currently active. If any roll a 5 or higher, one layer of the aura is destroyed and the attack fails. If all the results are 4 or lower, you take the damage and this spell ends",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/confusing-aura/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/conjure-swarm",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Conjure Swarm",
      "slug": "conjure-swarm",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "CONJURE SWARM",
        "lineStart": 15840,
        "lineEnd": 15848,
        "pdfPageStart": 219,
        "pdfPageEnd": 219
      },
      "level": 2,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/sage"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Tekaira Armored Beetles: Mark a Stress to conjure armored beetles that encircle you. When you next take damage, reduce the severity by one threshold. You can spend a Hope to keep the beetles conjured after taking damage.\n\nFire Flies: Make a Spellcast Roll against all adversaries within Close range. Spend a Hope to deal 2d8+3 magic damage to targets you succeeded against.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/conjure-swarm/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/conjured-steeds",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Conjured Steeds",
      "slug": "conjured-steeds",
      "sourceLocator": {
