      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Death Grip",
      "slug": "death-grip",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "DEATH GRIP",
        "lineStart": 15878,
        "lineEnd": 15893,
        "pdfPageStart": 219,
        "pdfPageEnd": 219
      },
      "level": 4,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/sage"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Close range and choose one of the following options:\n\n  - You pull the target into Melee range or pull yourself into\n\nMelee range of them.\n\n  - You constrict the target and force them to mark 2 Stress.\n  - All adversaries between you and the target must succeed on a Reaction Roll (13) or be hit by vines, taking 3d6+2 physical damage.\n\nOn a success, vines reach out from your hands, causing the chosen effect and temporarily Restraining the target.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/death-grip/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/deathrun",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Deathrun",
      "slug": "deathrun",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "DEATHRUN",
        "lineStart": 14958,
        "lineEnd": 14966,
        "pdfPageStart": 210,
        "pdfPageEnd": 210
      },
      "level": 10,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/bone"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Spend 3 Hope to run a straight path through the battlefield to a point within Far range, making an attack against all adversaries within your weapon’s range along that path. Choose the order in which you deal damage to the targets you succeeded against. For the first, roll your weapon damage with a +1 bonus to your Proficiency. Then remove a die from your damage roll and deal the remaining damage to the next target. Continue to remove a die for each subsequent target until you have no more damage dice or adversaries.\n\nYou can’t target the same adversary more than once per attack.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/deathrun/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/deft-deceiver",
