      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Once per long rest, spend 3 Hope to reach out to the forces beyond and ask one “yes or no” question about an event, person, place, or situation in the near future. For a moment, the present falls away and you see the answer before you.",
      "htmlPage": {
