        "heading": "ENDLESS CHARISMA",
        "lineStart": 15525,
        "lineEnd": 15531,
        "pdfPageStart": 216,
        "pdfPageEnd": 216
      },
      "level": 7,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/grace"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "After you make an action roll to persuade, lie, or garner favor, you can spend a Hope to reroll the Hope or Fear Die.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/endless-charisma/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/enrapture",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Enrapture",
      "slug": "enrapture",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "ENRAPTURE",
        "lineStart": 15415,
        "lineEnd": 15421,
        "pdfPageStart": 215,
        "pdfPageEnd": 215
      },
      "level": 1,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/grace"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 0,
      "rulesText": "Make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Close range. On a success, they become temporarily Enraptured. While Enraptured, a target’s attention is fixed on you, narrowing their field of view and drowning out any sound but your voice. Once per rest on a success, you can mark a Stress to force the Enraptured target to mark a Stress as well.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/enrapture/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/falling-sky",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Falling Sky",
      "slug": "falling-sky",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "FALLING SKY",
        "lineStart": 14575,
        "lineEnd": 14581,
        "pdfPageStart": 207,
        "pdfPageEnd": 207
      },
      "level": 10,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/arcana"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Make a Spellcast Roll against all adversaries within Far range. Mark any number of Stress to make shards of arcana rain down from above. Targets you succeed against take 1d20+2 magic damage for each Stress marked.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/falling-sky/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/fane-of-the-wilds",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Fane of the Wilds",
      "slug": "fane-of-the-wilds",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "FANE OF THE WILDS",
        "lineStart": 15989,
        "lineEnd": 16001,
        "pdfPageStart": 220,
        "pdfPageEnd": 220
      },
      "level": 9,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/sage"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "After a long rest, place a number of tokens equal to the number of Sage domain cards in your loadout and vault on this card.\n\nWhen you would make a Spellcast Roll, you can spend any number of tokens after the roll to gain a +1 bonus for each token spent.\n\nWhen you critically succeed on a Spellcast Roll for a Sage domain spell, gain a token.\n\nWhen you take a long rest, clear all unspent tokens.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/fane-of-the-wilds/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/ferocity",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Ferocity",
      "slug": "ferocity",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "FEROCITY",
        "lineStart": 14784,
        "lineEnd": 14790,
        "pdfPageStart": 209,
        "pdfPageEnd": 209
      },
      "level": 2,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/bone"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "When you cause an adversary to mark 1 or more Hit Points, you can spend 2 Hope to increase your Evasion by the number of Hit Points they marked. This bonus lasts until after the next attack made against you.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/ferocity/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
