      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Once per long rest, you can conjure a field of healing plants around you. Everywhere within Close range of you bursts to life with vibrant nature, allowing you and all allies in the area to clear a Hit Point.\n\nSpend 2 Hope to allow you and all allies to clear 2 Hit Points instead.",
