      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 3,
      "rulesText": "When you or an ally within Close range has used a feature that has an exhaustion limit (such as once per rest or once per session), you can spend any number of Hope and roll that many d6s. If any roll a 6, the feature can be used again.",
