      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "When an attack made against you from beyond Melee range fails, roll a number of d6s equal to your Proficiency. If any roll a 6, you can mark a Stress to redirect the attack to damage an adversary within Very Close range instead.",
