    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/rune-ward",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Rune Ward",
      "slug": "rune-ward",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "RUNE WARD",
        "lineStart": 14398,
        "lineEnd": 14406,
        "pdfPageStart": 206,
        "pdfPageEnd": 206
      },
      "level": 1,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/arcana"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 0,
      "rulesText": "You have a deeply personal trinket that can be infused with protective magic and held as a ward by you or an ally. Describe what it is and why it’s important to you. The ward’s holder can spend a Hope to reduce incoming damage by 1d8.\n\nIf the Ward Die result is 8, the ward’s power ends after it reduces damage this turn. It can be recharged for free on your next rest.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/rune-ward/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/safe-haven",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Safe Haven",
      "slug": "safe-haven",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "SAFE HAVEN",
        "lineStart": 15161,
        "lineEnd": 15169,
        "pdfPageStart": 212,
        "pdfPageEnd": 212
      },
      "level": 8,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 3,
      "rulesText": "When you have a few minutes of calm to focus, you can spend 2 Hope to summon your Safe Haven, a large interdimensional home where you and your allies can take shelter. When you do, a magical door appears somewhere within Close range. Only creatures of your choice can enter. Once inside, you can make the entrance invisible. You and anyone else inside can always exit. Once you leave, the doorway must be summoned again.\n\nWhen you take a rest within your own Safe Haven, you can choose an additional downtime move.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/safe-haven/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/sage-touched",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Sage‑touched",
      "slug": "sage-touched",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "SAGE‑TOUCHED",
        "lineStart": 15943,
        "lineEnd": 15953,
        "pdfPageStart": 220,
        "pdfPageEnd": 220
      },
      "level": 7,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/sage"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "When 4 or more of the domain cards in your loadout are from the Sage domain, gain the following benefits:\n\n  - While you’re in a natural environment, you gain a +2 bonus to your Spellcast Rolls.\n\n  - Once per rest, you can double your Agility or Instinct when making a roll that uses that trait. You must choose to do this before you roll.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/sage-touched/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/salvation-beam",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Salvation Beam",
      "slug": "salvation-beam",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
