      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "When you take magic damage, place tokens equal to the number of Hit Points you marked on this card. You can store a number of tokens equal to your Spellcast trait.\n\nWhen you make a successful attack against a target, you can spend any number of tokens to add a d6 for each token spent to your damage roll.",
