      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "When 4 or more of the domain cards in your loadout are from the Splendor domain, gain the following benefits:\n\n  - +3 bonus to your Severe damage threshold\n  - Once per long rest, when incoming damage would require you to mark a number of Hit Points, you can choose to mark that much Stress or spend that much Hope instead.",
