      "level": 9,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/bone"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 3,
      "rulesText": "Spend a Hope and make an attack against all adversaries within your weapon’s range. Once per long rest, on a success against any targets, roll your weapon's damage and distribute that damage however you wish between the targets you succeeded against. Before you deal damage to each target, roll an additional damage die and add its result to the damage you deal to them.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/splintering-strike/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/stealth-expertise",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Stealth Expertise",
      "slug": "stealth-expertise",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "STEALTH EXPERTISE",
        "lineStart": 15664,
        "lineEnd": 15672,
        "pdfPageStart": 217,
        "pdfPageEnd": 217
      },
      "level": 4,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/midnight"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 0,
      "rulesText": "When you roll with Fear while attempting to move unnoticed through a dangerous area, you can mark a Stress to roll with Hope instead.\n\nIf an ally within Close range is also attempting to move unnoticed and rolls with Fear, you can mark a Stress to change their result to a roll with Hope.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/stealth-expertise/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/strategic-approach",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Strategic Approach",
      "slug": "strategic-approach",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "STRATEGIC APPROACH",
        "lineStart": 14818,
        "lineEnd": 14830,
        "pdfPageStart": 209,
        "pdfPageEnd": 209
      },
      "level": 2,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/bone"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "After a long rest, place a number of tokens equal to your Knowledge on this card (minimum 1). The first time you move within Close range of an adversary and make an attack against them, you can spend one token to choose one of the following options:\n\n  - You make the attack with advantage.\n  - You clear a Stress on an ally within Melee range of the adversary.\n  - You add a d8 to your damage roll.\n\nWhen you take a long rest, clear all unspent tokens.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/strategic-approach/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/stunning-sunlight",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Stunning Sunlight",
      "slug": "stunning-sunlight",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "STUNNING SUNLIGHT",
        "lineStart": 16208,
        "lineEnd": 16216,
        "pdfPageStart": 222,
        "pdfPageEnd": 222
      },
      "level": 8,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/splendor"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Make a Spellcast Roll to unleash powerful rays of burning sunlight against all adversaries in front of you within Far range. On a success, spend any number of Hope and force that many targets you succeeded against to make a Reaction Roll (14).\n\nTargets who succeed take 3d20+3 magic damage. Targets who fail take 4d20+5 magic damage and are temporarily Stunned. While Stunned, they can’t use reactions and can’t take any other actions until they clear this condition.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/stunning-sunlight/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/summon-horror",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Summon Horror",
      "slug": "summon-horror",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "SUMMON HORROR",
        "lineStart": 15286,
        "lineEnd": 15294,
        "pdfPageStart": 214,
        "pdfPageEnd": 214
      },
      "level": 4,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/dread"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Once per scene, mark a Stress to summon an otherworldly creature that deals d8+1 magic damage using your Spellcast trait to a target within Far range. If the target marks any Hit Points from this attack, they must succeed on a Reaction Roll (12) to steel themselves against the horror or mark an equal number of Stress.\n\nAfter making the attack, the creature dissipates.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/summon-horror/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/support-tank",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Support Tank",
      "slug": "support-tank",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "SUPPORT TANK",
        "lineStart": 16316,
        "lineEnd": 16322,
        "pdfPageStart": 223,
        "pdfPageEnd": 223
      },
      "level": 4,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/valor"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "When an ally within Close range fails a roll, you can spend 2 Hope to allow them to reroll either their Hope or Fear Die.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/support-tank/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/swift-step",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Swift Step",
      "slug": "swift-step",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "SWIFT STEP",
        "lineStart": 14968,
        "lineEnd": 14974,
        "pdfPageStart": 210,
        "pdfPageEnd": 210
      },
      "level": 10,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/bone"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "When an attack made against you fails, clear a Stress. If you can’t clear a Stress, gain a Hope.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/swift-step/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/tactician",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Tactician",
      "slug": "tactician",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "TACTICIAN",
        "lineStart": 14840,
        "lineEnd": 14848,
        "pdfPageStart": 209,
        "pdfPageEnd": 209
      },
      "level": 3,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/bone"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "When you Help an Ally, they can spend a Hope to add one of your Experiences to their roll alongside your advantage die.\n\nWhen making a Tag Team Roll, you can roll a d20 as your Hope Die.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/tactician/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/telekinesis",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Telekinesis",
      "slug": "telekinesis",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "TELEKINESIS",
        "lineStart": 14506,
        "lineEnd": 14512,
        "pdfPageStart": 207,
        "pdfPageEnd": 207
      },
      "level": 6,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/arcana"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 0,
      "rulesText": "Make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Far range. On a success, you can use your mind to move them anywhere within Far range of their original position. You can throw the lifted target as an attack by making an additional Spellcast Roll against the second target you’re trying to attack. On a success, deal d12+4 physical damage to the second target using your Proficiency. This spell then ends.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/telekinesis/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/teleport",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Teleport",
      "slug": "teleport",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "TELEPORT",
        "lineStart": 15094,
        "lineEnd": 15107,
        "pdfPageStart": 212,
        "pdfPageEnd": 212
      },
      "level": 5,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Once per long rest, you can instantly teleport yourself and any number of willing targets within Close range to a place you’ve been before. Choose one of the following options, then make a Spellcast Roll (16):\n\n  - If you know the place very well, gain a +3 bonus.\n  - If you’ve visited the place frequently, gain a +1 bonus.\n  - If you’ve visited the place infrequently, gain no modifier.\n  - If you’ve only been there once, gain a −2 penalty.\n\nOn a success, you appear where you were intending to go. On a failure, you appear off course, with the range of failure determining how far off course.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/teleport/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/tell-no-lies",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Tell No Lies",
      "slug": "tell-no-lies",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "TELL NO LIES",
        "lineStart": 15437,
        "lineEnd": 15443,
        "pdfPageStart": 215,
        "pdfPageEnd": 215
      },
      "level": 2,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/grace"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Very Close range. On a success, they can’t lie to you while they remain within Close range, but they are not compelled to speak. If you ask them a question and they refuse to answer, they must mark a Stress and the effect ends. The target is typically unaware this spell has been cast on them until it causes them to utter the truth.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/tell-no-lies/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/tempest",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Tempest",
      "slug": "tempest",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "TEMPEST",
        "lineStart": 16029,
        "lineEnd": 16040,
        "pdfPageStart": 220,
        "pdfPageEnd": 220
      },
      "level": 10,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/sage"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "Choose one of the following tempests and make a Spellcast Roll against all targets within Far range. Targets you succeed against experience its effects until the GM spends a Fear on their turn to end this spell.\n\n  - Blizzard: Deal 2d20+8 magic damage and targets are temporararily Vulnerable.\n  - Hurricane: Deal 3d10+10 magic damage and choose a direction the wind is blowing. Targets can’t move against the wind.\n\n  - Sandstorm: Deal 5d6+9 magic damage. Attacks made from beyond Melee range have disadvantage.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/tempest/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/terrify",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Terrify",
      "slug": "terrify",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "TERRIFY",
        "lineStart": 15268,
        "lineEnd": 15274,
        "pdfPageStart": 213,
        "pdfPageEnd": 213
      },
      "level": 3,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/dread"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Make a Spellcast Roll against a target within Close range. On a success, the target marks 1d4 Stress, and you can make the target flee one range away from you (such as Very Close to Close or Close to Far). On a success with Fear, the target also becomes temporarily Vulnerable.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/terrify/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/thorn-skin",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Thorn Skin",
      "slug": "thorn-skin",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "THORN SKIN",
        "lineStart": 15905,
        "lineEnd": 15913,
        "pdfPageStart": 219,
        "pdfPageEnd": 219
      },
      "level": 5,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/sage"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Once per rest, spend a Hope to sprout thorns all over your body. When you do, place a number of tokens equal to your Spellcast trait on this card. When you take damage, you can spend any number of tokens to roll that number of d6s. Add the results together and reduce the incoming damage by that amount. If you’re within Melee range of the attacker, deal that amount of damage back to them.\n\nWhen you take a rest, clear all unspent tokens.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/thorn-skin/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/thought-delver",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Thought Delver",
      "slug": "thought-delver",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "THOUGHT DELVER",
        "lineStart": 15487,
        "lineEnd": 15495,
        "pdfPageStart": 215,
        "pdfPageEnd": 215
      },
      "level": 5,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/grace"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "You can peek into the minds of others. Spend a Hope to read the vague surface thoughts of a target within Far range. Make a Spellcast Roll against the target to delve for deeper, more hidden thoughts.\n\nOn a roll with Fear, the target might, at the GM’s discretion, become aware that you’re reading their thoughts.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/thought-delver/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/through-your-eyes",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Through Your Eyes",
      "slug": "through-your-eyes",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "THROUGH YOUR EYES",
        "lineStart": 15479,
        "lineEnd": 15485,
        "pdfPageStart": 215,
        "pdfPageEnd": 215
      },
      "level": 4,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/grace"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Choose a target within Very Far range. You can see through their eyes and hear through their ears. You can transition between using your own senses or the target’s freely until you cast another spell or until your next rest.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/through-your-eyes/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/towering-stalk",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Towering Stalk",
      "slug": "towering-stalk",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "TOWERING STALK",
        "lineStart": 15868,
        "lineEnd": 15876,
        "pdfPageStart": 219,
        "pdfPageEnd": 219
      },
      "level": 3,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/sage"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Once per rest, you can conjure a thick, twisting stalk within Close range that can be easily climbed. Its height can grow up to Far range.\n\nMark a Stress to use this spell as an attack. Make a Spellcast Roll against an adversary or group of adversaries within Close range. The erupting stalk lifts targets you succeed against into the air and drops them, dealing d8 physical damage using your Proficiency.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/towering-stalk/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/transcendent-union",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Transcendent Union",
      "slug": "transcendent-union",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "TRANSCENDENT UNION",
        "lineStart": 15242,
        "lineEnd": 15248,
        "pdfPageStart": 213,
        "pdfPageEnd": 213
      },
      "level": 10,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/codex"
      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "Once per long rest, spend 5 Hope to cast this spell on two or more willing creatures. Until your next rest, when a creature connected by this union would mark Stress or Hit Points, the connected creatures can choose who marks it.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/transcendent-union/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/troublemaker",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Troublemaker",
      "slug": "troublemaker",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "TROUBLEMAKER",
        "lineStart": 15445,
        "lineEnd": 15451,
        "pdfPageStart": 215,
        "pdfPageEnd": 215
      },
      "level": 2,
      "domain": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domains/grace"
      },
      "cardType": "Ability",
      "recallCost": 2,
      "rulesText": "When you taunt or provoke a target within Far range, make a Presence Roll against them. Once per rest on a success, roll a number of d4s equal to your Proficiency. The target must mark Stress equal to the highest result rolled.",
      "htmlPage": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/records/domain-cards/troublemaker/"
      },
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/sources/daggerheart-srd-2-0"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/daggerheart-system-json/objects/domain-cards/twilight-toll",
      "@type": "DomainCard",
      "name": "Twilight Toll",
      "slug": "twilight-toll",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "APPENDIX",
        "heading": "TWILIGHT TOLL",
