      },
      "cardType": "Spell",
      "recallCost": 1,
      "rulesText": "At the beginning of a session, place a number of tokens equal to your Spellcast trait on this card.\n\nMake a Spellcast Roll against a target within Far range and spend any number of tokens to channel raw energy from within yourself to unleash against them. On a success, roll a number of d10s equal to the tokens you spent and deal that much magic damage to the target. Mark a Stress to replenish this card with tokens (up to your Spellcast trait).\n\nAt the end of each session, clear all unspent tokens.",
